"""The world's disputed territories (Natural Earth 1:10m admin-0 disputed areas), for the disputes layer
(tools/build_disputes.py -> data/disputes.json). Keyed by Natural Earth's BRK_NAME.

Fields: name (shown), admin (who governs it), claim (who else claims it), since (when the dispute began), info (a sentence or
two). country: the ISO code of a country on the world map whose card gets the dispute instead of a separate tap area (the
whole country is the disputed territory: Taiwan, Kosovo...). group: entries shown as one (Jerusalem's pieces). skip: not
shown (Natural Earth artefacts, not disputes).
Written from general knowledge; neutral wording (who governs, who claims), as the app does elsewhere; checked by hand.
"""

